      "document": {
        "resourceId": "IP1-general-document-01",
        "sourceVersionId": "IP1-general-document-01-A",
        "title": "Visitor pass coverage",
        "format": "html",
        "extractorVersion": "structured-v2-compatible-fixture",
        "structureProvenance": "assistant-authored; not an extraction run",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "IP1-G01-B01",
            "order": 0,
            "kind": "heading",
            "text": "Visitor pass coverage",
            "metadata": {
              "schemaVersion": 1,
              "links": [],
              "level": 2
            },
            "textSha256": "32f14fb1e3959b23070cf5d58414332588835cc6d2b100cf8bfa807a3a2608cb"
          },
          {
            "id": "IP1-G01-B02",
            "order": 1,
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "The museum issues a temporary pass to visiting researchers. The following paragraph defines the access granted by this pass, rather than by a permanent staff badge.",
            "metadata": {
              "schemaVersion": 1,
              "links": []
            },
            "textSha256": "5d4e81989e2083fb9cd9b1eb4a8503a59a1c7a6bef9ba75264dc3dd2dd72c1da"
          },
          {
            "id": "IP1-G01-B03",
            "order": 2,
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "It does not exclude the temporary storage room from the areas a visitor may enter. The security check still applies to every visitor, regardless of the rooms listed on the permit. Holders may enter the reading room only with a guide. Staff must record the time when the pass is returned, even if its holder has visited just one room.",
            "metadata": {
              "schemaVersion": 1,
              "links": []
            },
            "textSha256": "2e5c81bf79cc69b19605a5cf12e4b0d48c0e880c2d68dd4f241a8b8906a2671f"
          },
          {
            "id": "IP1-G01-B04",
            "order": 3,
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "At the end of each visit, the reception team files the access record with the daily attendance sheet.",
            "metadata": {
              "schemaVersion": 1,
              "links": []
            },
            "textSha256": "8ce77d1e1b2db1612dc3e2c3790f1c3e07054b272876a331c84bddf93941335b"
          }
        ],
        "titleKo": ""
      },
      "targetBlockId": "IP1-G01-B03"
    },
