      "document": {
        "resourceId": "IP1-general-document-02",
        "sourceVersionId": "IP1-general-document-02-A",
        "title": "Visitor access and maintenance",
        "format": "html",
        "extractorVersion": "structured-v2-compatible-fixture",
        "structureProvenance": "assistant-authored; not an extraction run",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "IP1-G03-B01",
            "order": 0,
            "kind": "heading",
            "text": "Visitor access and maintenance",
            "metadata": {
              "schemaVersion": 1,
              "links": [],
              "level": 2
            },
            "textSha256": "674b485c893eb25f9f39a1fc38e4ce9472299006fd14fa7349a821931d28f9af"
          },
          {
            "id": "IP1-G03-B02",
            "order": 1,
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "The museum has a public admission service at its main gate. A maintenance period is shown separately on the calendar, and the next paragraph explains when the admission service operates.",
            "metadata": {
              "schemaVersion": 1,
              "links": []
            },
            "textSha256": "1f234532aa04da6a43a94f5904ac19b4a941c76815ee18aa24b15a630d689980"
          },
          {
            "id": "IP1-G03-B03",
            "order": 2,
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "It operates only after the maintenance period, according to the schedule issued by the museum. The security team supervises the main gate whenever the service is operating. The maintenance crew uses a separate entrance, so its arrival does not establish that the main gate is open. Visitors must consult the posted schedule rather than infer opening hours from the presence of workers.",
            "metadata": {
              "schemaVersion": 1,
              "links": []
            },
            "textSha256": "b0290c951448dfab3f7d31911c5ab2d958edf4e10ceb9c9e651e949fac690397"
          },
          {
            "id": "IP1-G03-B04",
            "order": 3,
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "Questions about the calendar go to the reception office; equipment requests go to the maintenance supervisor.",
            "metadata": {
              "schemaVersion": 1,
              "links": []
            },
            "textSha256": "94ba7687e629dd4c52a23d34cf4e2eb277af059b09a39262105d797a419890f8"
          }
        ],
        "titleKo": ""
      },
      "targetBlockId": "IP1-G03-B03"
    },
