      "document": {
        "resourceId": "IP1-general-document-04",
        "sourceVersionId": "IP1-general-document-04-A",
        "title": "Equity in workshop scheduling",
        "format": "html",
        "extractorVersion": "structured-v2-compatible-fixture",
        "structureProvenance": "assistant-authored; not an extraction run",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "IP1-G07-B01",
            "order": 0,
            "kind": "heading",
            "text": "Equity in workshop scheduling",
            "metadata": {
              "schemaVersion": 1,
              "links": [],
              "level": 2
            },
            "textSha256": "29747da2504e44a1987a1c6829b0df224b91239c9e0d0f74e7718f1c15cf66a5"
          },
          {
            "id": "IP1-G07-B02",
            "order": 1,
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "The workshop council is testing a session rule. In its report, equity concerns how fairly participants receive teaching time. The next paragraph states the requirement of this particular rule.",
            "metadata": {
              "schemaVersion": 1,
              "links": []
            },
            "textSha256": "7d6dbbfa1d00738f06db9f08dba9706db39f3e73e0520789a44faab6bfb1bd8b"
          },
          {
            "id": "IP1-G07-B03",
            "order": 2,
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "Under this rule, equity requires identical session lengths for every participant. Their interest in the topic is recorded in a separate survey and does not change the rule. The coordinator uses this record to plan optional reading, while attendance is entered in another register. The report evaluates access to teaching; it does not describe an investment or a share of a company.",
            "metadata": {
              "schemaVersion": 1,
              "links": []
            },
            "textSha256": "d83ac319fe3b0e8f41355299e2d83493fa14f5b7e923eeb67cd8defdf24acf0a"
          },
          {
            "id": "IP1-G07-B04",
            "order": 3,
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "The council will discuss the trial report at its next meeting before deciding whether to keep the rule.",
            "metadata": {
              "schemaVersion": 1,
              "links": []
            },
            "textSha256": "3ac6fd1a1e900286d505596b7634e11ba5d584604406034d8345465bcf81fe39"
          }
        ],
        "titleKo": ""
      },
      "targetBlockId": "IP1-G07-B03"
    },
