            "order": 2,
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "Under this rule, equity does not require identical session lengths for every participant. Their interest in the topic is recorded in a separate survey and does not change the rule. The coordinator uses this record to plan optional reading, while attendance is entered in another register. The report evaluates access to teaching; it does not describe an investment or a share of a company.",
